18:T1012,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":["Article","BlogPosting"],"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/"},"author":{"name":"KOTA","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/person/0920247d2c12a3b934d2bf67a73d97a2"},"headline":"KOTA wins a Lovie award for Best Web Design – Aesthetic!","datePublished":"2025-11-06T09:00:54+00:00","dateModified":"2026-07-16T09:50:39+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/"},"wordCount":10,"publisher":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2025/11/Lovie-awards.png","articleSection":["Culture","Our work"],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/","url":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/","name":"KOTA wins a Lovie award for Best Web Design – Aesthetic! - KOTA","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/#primaryimage"},"image":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2025/11/Lovie-awards.png","datePublished":"2025-11-06T09:00:54+00:00","dateModified":"2026-07-16T09:50:39+00:00","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/#primaryimage","url":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2025/11/Lovie-awards.png","contentUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2025/11/Lovie-awards.png","width":1400,"height":787},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/blog/kota-wins-a-lovie-award-for-best-web-design-aesthetic/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://kota.co.uk/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"KOTA wins a Lovie award for Best Web Design – Aesthetic!"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#website","url":"https://kota.co.uk/","name":"KOTA","description":"","publisher":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#organization"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://kota.co.uk/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#organization","name":"KOTA","alternateName":"KOTA creative","url":"https://kota.co.uk/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/logo/image/","url":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/11/Logo-Profile.png","contentUrl":"https://kota.co.uk/app/uploads/2024/11/Logo-Profile.png","width":1080,"height":1080,"caption":"KOTA"},"image":{"@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/logo/image/"},"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/kotacreative/","https://x.com/kotacreative"]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/person/0920247d2c12a3b934d2bf67a73d97a2","name":"KOTA","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://kota.co.uk/#/schema/person/image/","url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/997a25aeeb59c30e7b958976b63b4e9a84a8addc4e811d9c09e6a924a059c98e?s=96&d=mm&r=g","contentUrl":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/997a25aeeb59c30e7b958976b63b4e9a84a8addc4e811d9c09e6a924a059c98e?s=96&d=mm&r=g","caption":"KOTA"},"sameAs":["https://kota.co.uk/wp"],"url":"https://kota.co.uk/author/kota/"}]}1e:T19d3,<p data-start="398" data-end="568">Big news. We’ve taken home <a href="https://winners.lovieawards.com/categories/details/2025/websites-mobile-sites/website-mobile-site-craft/best-web-design-aesthetic/?utm_campaign=lovie15_finalist_winnernotification_1106&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=cio#w356812" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong data-start="427" data-end="462">Silver at the 2025 Lovie Awards</strong> for <strong><em data-start="1777" data-end="1806">Best Web Design – Aesthetic</em></strong></a> for our work with <strong data-start="518" data-end="525">UPP</strong>, one of Hollywood’s leading VFX studios.</p>
<p data-start="570" data-end="671">The project set out to match UPP’s cinematic scale, and the Lovies have confirmed we hit the mark.</p>
<h2 data-start="678" data-end="716">A website that moves like a movie</h2>
<p data-start="718" data-end="985">UPP aren’t your average production studio. They’re the people behind <em data-start="787" data-end="795">Barbie</em>, <em data-start="797" data-end="816">Blade Runner 2049</em>, and more recently the Hulu TV hit <em data-start="822" data-end="834">Alien: Earth. T</em>hey didn’t want a static portfolio. They wanted something that <em data-start="929" data-end="936">feels</em> like their world: dynamic, layered, and alive.</p>
<p data-start="987" data-end="1253">So we built an experience that moves with intention. Lighting that shifts with time of day. Seamless transitions that feel like camera moves. Motion that directs your eye, not distracts it. Every detail was tuned to carry UPP’s cinematic energy into the browser.</p>
<p data-start="1255" data-end="1371">The result is a digital space that looks beautiful, performs fast, and tells a story you want to stick around for.</p>
<h2 data-start="1378" data-end="1406">Why a Lovie win matters</h2>
<p data-start="1408" data-end="1616">The <strong data-start="1412" data-end="1428">Lovie Awards</strong> are Europe’s biggest celebration of creativity on the internet. They recognise digital work that pushes the medium forward, not just in how it looks, but in how it makes people <em>feel. </em>Past winners include the BBC, Adidas, and Spotify!</p>
<p data-start="1751" data-end="1970">To be named among them in <em data-start="1777" data-end="1806">Best Web Design – Aesthetic</em> means our work with UPP stood out for its craft, storytelling, and impact. It’s a reminder that web design can be cinematic. And that craft still cuts through.</p>
<blockquote>
<p data-start="1751" data-end="1970">“This year’s Lovie winners embody the creativity, innovation, and spirit that make the European Internet so extraordinary,” said Jesse Feister, Executive Director of the Lovie Awards. “Across every category, we saw work blending art, technology, and humanity in inspiring ways. These creators and teams represent the best of what the Internet can be: bold, purposeful, and deeply connected to the people it serves. We’re proud to celebrate their achievements.”</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 data-start="1977" data-end="2024">Built by a team who sweat the small stuff</h2>
<p data-start="2026" data-end="2202">This one took everyone: design, dev, motion, and strategy all working in sync from day one. Every transition, every lighting cue, every line of code had to pull its weight.</p>
<p data-start="2204" data-end="2381">UPP trusted us to create something bold, and we pushed every part of the process to match that ambition. The kind of collaboration that reminds you why you love what you do.</p>
<h2 data-start="2388" data-end="2411">The bigger picture</h2>
<p data-start="2413" data-end="2599">Web design is evolving fast. Users expect more. Depth, movement, emotion. Our win with UPP shows how powerful it can be when storytelling and technology actually talk to each other.</p>
<p data-start="2601" data-end="2768">This is what we mean when we say <em data-start="2634" data-end="2656">cinematic web design</em>. Not gimmicks. Not 3D for the sake of it. Just beautifully considered experiences that leave an impression.</p>
<h2 data-start="2775" data-end="2796">Project credits</h2>
<p data-start="2797" data-end="3011"><strong data-start="2797" data-end="2808">Client:</strong> Universal Production Partners (UPP)<br data-start="2844" data-end="2847" /><strong data-start="2847" data-end="2857">Award:</strong> Silver Lovie Award 2025 – Best Web Design (Aesthetic)<br data-start="2911" data-end="2914" /><strong data-start="2914" data-end="2927">Category:</strong> Websites &amp; Mobile Sites<br data-start="2951" data-end="2954" /><strong data-start="2954" data-end="2969">Created by:</strong> KOTA<br data-start="2974" data-end="2977" /><a class="decorated-link" href="https://kota.co.uk/work/upp/" rel="noopener" data-start="2977" data-end="3011"><strong data-start="2978" data-end="3007">Explore the UPP project →</strong></a></p>
<p data-start="3018" data-end="3121">Silver looks good on us!</p>
<h2>About The Lovie Awards</h2>
<p>The Lovie Awards is the largest pan-European Award to recognise the unique and resonant nature of the European Internet—from Europe’s top web and creative networks and content publishers, to cultural and political organisations and individual creators. With 1000 entries from over 30 countries across Europe, the Awards reflect the tremendous growth of the Internet as a tool for business and everyday lives. Work in English, French, German, Spanish, Dutch, Swedish, and Italian is judged by native speakers in seven main category types: AI &amp; Immersive, Apps, Platforms &amp; Software, Film &amp; Video, Podcasts, Marketing, Advertising &amp; PR, Social, Websites &amp; Mobile Sites, and Beyond Categories. Lovie Award Sponsors and Partners include; In-House Agency Lead Club (IHALC), Semaine, New Digital Age, It’s Nice That, FRIEZE, and Eurowaves.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3><strong>About KOTA</strong></h3>
<p>KOTA is a <a href="https://kota.co.uk/">global branding agency and creative web design studio</a>. Our brand-to-build approach brings <a href="https://kota.co.uk/service/brand-strategy">strategy</a>, <a href="https://kota.co.uk/service/brand-identity-design">identity</a>, <a href="https://kota.co.uk/service/creative-web-design/">creative web design</a>, <a href="https://kota.co.uk/service/web-development/">development</a> and <a href="https://kota.co.uk/service/growth-marketing/">growth marketing</a> into one connected process. We help ambitious businesses find brand clarity, turn it into creatively confident work and build digital systems that create commercial momentum.</p>
